## Troops Additional Copy Cost
800 Points:
For each unit in the Troop section, the first four copies cost their normal points;
each additional copy costs 20 additional points.

1200 Points:
For each unit in the Troop section, the first six copies cost their normal points;
each additional copy costs 20 additional points.

1600 Points:
For each unit in the Troop section, the first eight copies cost their normal points;
each additional copy costs 20 additional points.

## Other Additional Copy Cost
800 Points:
For each unit in the Elites, Support and Transport sections, the first copy costs its normal points;
each additional copy costs 20 additional points.

1200 Points:
For each unit in the Elites, Support and Transport sections, the first two copies cost their normal points;
each additional copy costs 20 additional points.

1600 Points:
For each unit in the Elites, Support and Transport sections, the first three copies cost their normal points;
each additional copy costs 20 additional points.
